# ADAPTIVE INSTITUTIONAL SUITE v19.0
# ============================================================================
# Professional-grade strategy implementation with:
# - Symmetric Buy/Sell logic (Z-scores, ATR, StdDev)
# - Dynamic Risk Engine with tiered lot sizing
